{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13224080","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322408001:2":{"text":"정신 차려요. 이건 위대한 의지와는 전혀 상관이 없다고요.","source_cn":"清醒一点，这根本没什么伟大意志。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDA61B3575334658","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322408002:1":{"text":"당신의 가르침을 기꺼이 들을 테니... 신실한 신도의 부름에 응답해 주십시오...","source_cn":"我愿意聆听您的指引……回应您的虔诚信徒吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A1762118E0FD8BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322408003:1":{"text":"저를 인도해 주십시오. 당신이 계신 곳이라면 불길 속이라도 뛰어들겠습니다!","source_cn":"请指引我方向，只要是您在的地方我就算赴汤蹈火也在所不辞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0862320D053096FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322408004:1":{"text":"이교도들과 말이 통할 것 같지 않아요. 저들을 구슬릴 방법을 찾아야 해요.","source_cn":"看样子这些邪教徒暂时听不进去话了，得想个办法把他哄走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBF7DB71E3F6631C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322408005:1":{"text":"구슬린다고? 어떻게? 저들의 머릿속에는 “위대한 의지” 밖에 없어!","source_cn":"哄？要怎么哄？他们脑子里只有那个什么“伟大意志”！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65F7BD634449CC1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1322408005":{"text":"구슬린다고? 어떻게? 저들의 머릿속에는 “위대한 의지” 밖에 없어!","source_cn":"哄？要怎么哄？他们脑子里只有那个什么“伟大意志”！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65F7BD634449CC1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322408006:1":{"text":"음... 생각났어요!","source_cn":"嗯……有了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1259C51BB4DB018D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322408007:1":{"text":"신실한 신도들이여, 신의 인도를 들으세요! 위대한 의지는 저 앞에 있으니 우리를 따라오세요!","source_cn":"虔诚的信徒们，聆听神的引导！伟大意志就在前方，跟随我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB45726D95D0B5182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322408008:1":{"text":"위대한 의지여... 다, 당신의 목소리를 들었습니다! 가겠습니다. 영원히 따르겠습니다!","source_cn":"伟大意志，我……似乎听到您的声音了！我来了，我永远跟随您！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE975B06B04C334FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322408009:1":{"text":"대단하네, 해미.","source_cn":"真有你的，漫漫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D1940EF65CC3825","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_st